! ============================================================================
! AMPS SEP geospace validation test C12
! Particle-mover validation in a centered, aligned analytical dipole
!
! run_C12.py replaces every double-underscore placeholder below and preserves each rendered deck in
! the corresponding case directory. The mover itself is supplied with
! ``-mover`` because that is the authoritative production dispatch path.
!
! IMPORTANT UNIT CONTRACT
! -----------------------
! The common AMPS parameter parser interprets bare DOMAIN_* and R_INNER lengths
! as kilometers. Earlier C12 decks wrote 35 and 1 while intending Earth radii;
! that put the 9000- and 25000-km observation shells outside a 35-km box. The
! runner now converts the requested box size from Re to km before rendering it.
! ============================================================================

#CALCULATION_MODE
CALC_TARGET                    CUTOFF_RIGIDITY
FIELD_EVAL_METHOD              GRIDLESS

#CUTOFF_RIGIDITY
! Energy values are MeV/n. UPPER_SCAN and ACCURATE tracing are selected on the
! command line so the archived invocation and the solver log show the exact
! search contract.
CUTOFF_EMIN                    __CUTOFF_EMIN_MEV__
CUTOFF_EMAX                    __CUTOFF_EMAX_MEV__
CUTOFF_MAX_PARTICLES           500
CUTOFF_NENERGY                 200
CUTOFF_SAMPLING                VERTICAL
CUTOFF_MAX_TRAJ_TIME           __MAX_TRACE_TIME__

#PARTICLE_SPECIES
SPECIES                        PROTON
CHARGE                         1
MASS_AMU                       1.007276466621

#BACKGROUND_FIELD
! DIPOLE_TILT=0 aligns the magnetic axis with GSM Z. The default spherical
! shell is also defined directly in GSM, so shell latitude is the magnetic
! latitude used by the analytical Stoermer equation.
FIELD_MODEL                    DIPOLE
DIPOLE_MOMENT                  1.0
DIPOLE_TILT                    0.0

#DOMAIN_BOUNDARY
! All six box coordinates and R_INNER are explicit kilometer values. The
! default +/-35-Re box becomes +/-222992 km and encloses both C12 shells.
DOMAIN_X_MIN                  __DOMAIN_MIN_KM__
DOMAIN_X_MAX                   __DOMAIN_MAX_KM__
DOMAIN_Y_MIN                  __DOMAIN_MIN_KM__
DOMAIN_Y_MAX                   __DOMAIN_MAX_KM__
DOMAIN_Z_MIN                  __DOMAIN_MIN_KM__
DOMAIN_Z_MAX                   __DOMAIN_MAX_KM__
R_INNER                       __R_INNER_KM__

#ELECTRIC_FIELD
! No electric field is configured. C12 isolates magnetic particle pushing,
! trajectory classification, and cutoff search behavior.

#SPECTRUM
! The common parser requires a spectrum block. Cutoff tracing uses the energy
! interval above, not this intensity normalization.
SPECTRUM_TYPE                  POWER_LAW
SPEC_J0                        1.0
SPEC_GAMMA                     3.0
SPEC_E0                        100.0
SPEC_EMIN                      0.05
SPEC_EMAX                      20000.0

#OUTPUT_DOMAIN
! Do not request GEODETIC geometry: GEO/WGS-84 -> GSM rotation would make GEO
! latitude an invalid substitute for magnetic latitude in the Stoermer formula.
OUTPUT_MODE                    SHELLS
SHELL_COUNT                    __SHELL_COUNT__
SHELL_ALTS_KM                  __SHELL_ALTS_KM__
SHELL_LON_RES_DEG              __SHELL_LON_RES_DEG__
SHELL_LAT_RES_DEG              __SHELL_LAT_RES_DEG__

#OUTPUT_OPTIONS
OUTPUT_COORDS                  GSM

#NUMERICAL
! The routine profile renders full-orbit cases at DT_TRACE=1, 0.5, and 0.25 s.
! With ADAPTIVE_DT=T these are successive maximum-step caps, not guaranteed
! fixed steps; the runner therefore records their map differences as a
! diagnostic. A hard convergence campaign must render ADAPTIVE_DT=F. Opt-in
! GC movers use the finest requested cap, but their reduced trajectories are
! treated as capability results rather than analytical Stoermer solutions.
DT_TRACE                       __DT_TRACE__
ADAPTIVE_DT                    __ADAPTIVE_DT__
MAX_STEPS                      __MAX_STEPS__
MAX_TRACE_TIME                 __MAX_TRACE_TIME__
MAX_TRACE_DISTANCE             __MAX_TRACE_DISTANCE_RE__
TRAP_DETECTION                 T

! Passive provenance comments retained in every rendered case deck:
! C12_MOVER                    __MOVER__
! C12_DT_SCALE                 __DT_SCALE__
! C12_REFERENCE                Rc=R0*cos(latitude)^4/r_RE^2
! C12_COORDINATES              spherical GSM shell

!#END
